# macro-indicators zone — .gitignore
# Security: no credentials, no local env overrides committed.

# Environment files — NEVER commit (charter §Security Clause: FRED_API_KEY, DB credentials)
.env
.env.local
.env.test
.env.*.local
.env.production

# Go build artefacts
/bin/
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# Sandbox binary (if compiled — prefer go run in pilot)
# Anchored to repo-relative root of this .gitignore (apps/macro-indicators/sandbox)
# so it matches ONLY the compiled binary, not the cmd/sandbox/ source directory
# (FACTORY-MACRO-split-sandbox, 2026-07-09 — unanchored pattern was silently
# excluding new files added under cmd/sandbox/ from git status/add).
/sandbox

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Node / Bun (legacy TS scrapers)
node_modules/
